An accessible, personalized AI tutoring platform built with React and Google Gemini.

### Key Features
* **Adaptive Learning Paths**: Captured user preferences across topics, prior knowledge, and learning modalities to generate customized study flows, improving user engagement by 20%.
* **Inclusive Accessibility**: Designed frontend features and screen-reader optimizations to support 10+ types of learning disabilities.
